are like five million dollars I think that's no&nbsp;
indy five million dollars in today's economy be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:23.200
great that the toys that we have that we can make&nbsp;
movies for but back then we were doing the indies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:28.640
for eight to 12 million what should a filmmaker&nbsp;
use to determine a budget whatever he can get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:37.600
and I mean that I I'm a big proponent of what's&nbsp;
your budget who cares I so many of us it's it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:43.360
about a budget you can get it broken down six&nbsp;
ways till sunday ten different line producers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:47.760
break it down budget it you can use all your&nbsp;
different pay scales with the unions and whatnot&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:52.800
that's all that's all going to be black and&nbsp;
white but at the end of the day what's stopping&nbsp;&nbsp;

