00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:14.240
asset to you 20 years from now and I think it&nbsp;
just in most of the the the talks that we give&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:19.680
with with producers and webinars it's it's the&nbsp;
main reason people are not making their content&nbsp;&nbsp;

