think sometimes if they they really really learn&nbsp;
the craft of of how to get things done and not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:36.080
chins out on what your ultimate vision is I mean&nbsp;
it's not about cheapening out or chinzing out okay&nbsp;&nbsp;

