00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:31.200
you have to look long-term it's like when you put&nbsp;
money into a cd or an ira it's long-term growth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:36.000
and you have to look at this career like that&nbsp;
because having a script you're running around town&nbsp;&nbsp;

